{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runewood: Hundred Nights\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>roguelite survival card game</strong> set in the dark heart of the Sylvanian forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the legend spoken of in whispers: The one who survived a hundred nights in the wild Runewoods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>...Or was it you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Collect cards, cast powerful spells, and equip legendary artifacts to push your luck through the endless nights. Trade what you find for coins, or hoard your treasures for the battles ahead. Every decision might be your last.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each night survived, you\u2019ll choose your path. Will you challenge the machines of the <strong>Robotics Bay</strong>? Maybe face the ruthless warriors of the <strong>Tribal Grounds</strong>? Or wander deeper into the cursed <strong>Enchanted Forest</strong> where the woods themselves remember your name?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever path you take, <strong>your survival writes the legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161360/extras/3d57b138026a360bc41b4f5665f136ff.avif?t=1764577426\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for cards, gather relics, and outlast the cold shadows of Runewood. There\u2019s no comfort here. Only the forest, with your decissions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>AUTOBATTLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your equipment, purchase cards, and let the battle unfold. Each day is a clash of strategy and chance. It's a dance of spells, claws, and steel you can only influence but never fully control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death isn\u2019t the end, it\u2019s a lesson. Learn the habitants of each area, best card combinations, the power of the runes, which pull you deeper into the legend of the Hundred Nights. Learn, adapt, and maybe this time, the forest will remember your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161360/extras/4924787b79352071cbf12764806bd5e2.avif?t=1764577426\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of\u00a0<i>\u201cShipping 24 Games in 24 Months.\u201d</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Hardest Part","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/d9d6a126ddbf343c0202570021704d9477900645.jpg"},{"name":"Shielded Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/8b015d32980737dac3f2d1d7528faaf189080386.jpg"},{"name":"Survived a Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/a2ce559f1d753814eb1349168240d849ea253425.jpg"},{"name":"The Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/815f73be0c56b75db9d0a5ec855ed87cb2abb22a.jpg"},{"name":"My Tummy Feels Funny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/97c3a68b05934b55cfaabc1143b289c8660a19f6.jpg"},{"name":"Warm & Cozy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/033b9e2f9b6eefa98a78671fc46ad2c83e9bda60.jpg"},{"name":"Is it you, Dasher?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4161360/6c1b25cb5cc9ce0a1e98760870812fdf79758e4d.jpg"},{"name":"Trader","path":"http